# This directory holds the local APT repository's generated state.
# setup-repo.sh creates:
#   gpg-home/                     ← throwaway GPG key pair (PRIVATE — gitignored)
#   aptly.conf                    ← generated aptly config (gitignored)
#   nanobot-poc-public.gpg        ← exported public key (gitignored)
# Keep this placeholder so the directory exists right after `git clone`,
# because setup-repo.sh writes gpg-home/ here.
